  "document": "Marv Skie–Lincoln County Airport\nMarv Skie–Lincoln County Airport (FAA LID: Y14) is a public use airport in Lincoln County, South Dakota, United States. It is owned by Lincoln County and located two nautical miles (4 km) northeast of the central business district of Tea, South Dakota. This airport is included in the National Plan of Integrated Airport Systems for 2011–2015, which categorized it as a \"general aviation\" facility."
